R4c3_gdn_q8_packed_transpose kernel=gated_delta_net_q8_fast lever=gdn_q8_packed_transpose verdict=DEAD delta_pct=-0.16 f=0.486 learned=Packing four strided Q8 byte planes into one dword load plus wave transpose kept VGPR at 64 but raised observed occ 17.1->25.2% and mem_busy 32.6->50.1% without throughput lift; TLP already hides state-reload latency, so extra shuffles only trade issue classes.
R3c1_gdn_uniform_ab_bcast kernel=gated_delta_net_q8_fast lever=gdn_uniform_ab_bcast verdict=DEAD delta_pct=-0.03 f=0.469 learned=Lane-0 broadcasting of the block-uniform gate/beta left VGPR at 64 and only shifted occ 16.5->17.4%, L2 85.0->86.3%, and mem_busy 31.8->33.2%; redundant expf/beta work is not the limiter, so this L2-resident state machine needs a different lever.
