R5c3_grouped_wmma_header_u64 kernel=gemm_hfq4g256_moe_grouped_wmma_gfx12 lever=grouped_wmma_header_u64 verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.03 f=0.562 learned=Combining adjacent scale/zero-point header loads into one 64-bit load preserved VGPR 64 and left occ 93.2%, L2 77.1%, and mem_busy 97.1%; the kernel is saturated at its memory roofline, so header VMEM issue count is not the limiter.
