R4c2_rms_signs_prefetch kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_signs_prefetch verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.98 f=0.625 learned=Gfx12 sign-cache hints raised VGPR 48->56 while the one-block kernel stayed at 0.2% occupancy and L2 fell 73.7->72.7%; structural underoccupancy dominates, so prefetch is not the per-wave MLP lever.
R7c3_rms_phase1_x_lds kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_phase1_x_lds verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.38 f=0.500 learned=Reusing Phase-1 x through 8 KiB LDS preserved VGPR at 48 and raised mem_busy 18.1->29.4% but left the one-block kernel at 0.2% occupancy; redundant L2 x traffic is not limiting, and the real lever remains per-wave MLP under catastrophic structural underoccupancy.
