R11c3_qkv_k2048_specialize kernel=fused_qkv_hfq4g256 lever=qkv_k2048_specialize verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.32 f=0.531 learned=Hard-specializing the hot K=2048 path raised VGPR 72->96 while occupancy stayed 53.6% and mem_busy 56.4%; TLP already hides latency, so removing dynamic loop/tail control adds register pressure without exposing a throughput lever.
