R12c2_gdn_scalevec4_packed kernel=gated_delta_net_q8_fast lever=scalevec4_packed verdict=VARIANT_BUILD_FAIL delta_pct=0 f=0 learned=BOD remains an L2-resident mixed state machine (85.0% L2 hit, mem_busy 31.8%, occ 16.5%, VGPR 64); no profile was produced because daemon build integration rejected the gfx12-only scale-vector source even though standalone hipcc compiled it.
